ace of despair</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collapsing spaceship. Resources nearly gone. In this extreme scenario, where repair, combat, and exploration are all trade-offs, you must make the boldest\u2014and most careful\u2014choices to survive.</p></li></ul>","developers":["727 Not Hound"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879060/0e1d7c8089b620a83d7cf486096d494cd20872d1/header.jpg?t=1755389016","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3879060/494818602/2a2bac21c3cae31ca5df5b87e5d5953e6509f3da/1753272975/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753331569","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3879060/494818602/2a2bac21c3cae31ca5df5b87e5d5953e6509f3da/1753272975/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753331569","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3879060/494818602/2a2bac21c3cae31ca5df5b87e5d5953e6509f3da/1753272975/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753331569","id":257172821,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172821/movie480.mp4?t=1753331569","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172821/movie_max.mp4?t=1753331569"},"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172821/4a6a9b78877154614ae8967788878bfe10734fe7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753331569","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172821/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753331569","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172821/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=175333